menu "Diagnostic web interface"

    config DIAG_ENABLE_RAW_SEND
        bool "Compile in POST /api/diag/raw (forward request body unchanged to the printer)"
        default y
        help
            Development aid for phase 3: lets you send a print file that was
            produced by the ORIGINAL Brother driver ("print to file") to the
            printer. It is available after boot (like a network printer it
            accepts print data from the local network); 'raw_send off' on the
            serial console disables it until restart.

    config WEB_OTA_ENABLE
        bool "Firmware update over the web interface (POST /api/system/ota)"
        default y
        help
            Upload of brother_printserver.bin from the web interface. Accepted
            only from the home network, never over the open setup access point.
            The image is verified before it is activated; a firmware that does
            not start is rolled back by the bootloader.

endmenu
